@project gudea
@lang sux
@name epsd2/sux

@entry a [water] N
@bases a (e₄); a₂ (A₂)
@form a /a #~
@form a₂-ba /a₂ +-ba=b.a  #~
@sense N water
@sense N semen
@end entry

@entry* a a [~water] N
@parts a[water]N a[water]N
@form a_a
@sense N watery water
@end entry

@entry a dug [to demolish] V/t
@parts a[water]N dug[speak]V/t#~;a
@form a_mu-dug₄
@sense V/t to demolish
@sense V/t to rumble
@end entry

@entry dug [speak] V/t
@bases dug₄
@form mu-dug₄ /dug₄ #mu:~
@sense V/t to speak
@end entry
